	// chose, with the granted scopes, projects and expiry. Errors are in
	// OAuth's shape (s5.2): `invalid_request`, `invalid_client` (401),
	// `invalid_grant`, `unsupported_grant_type`; `slow_down` (429) when
	// an address tries too often.
